{"speciesId":371,"names":{"fr":"Draby","es":"Bagon","en":"Bagon","ja":"タツベイ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"BAGON has a dream of one day soaring in the sky. In doomed efforts to fly, this POKéMON hurls itself off cliffs. As a result of its dives, its head has grown tough and as hard as tempered steel."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"BAGON harbors a never-ending dream of one day soaring high among the clouds. As if trying to dispel its frustration over its inability to fly, this POKéMON slams its hard head against huge rocks and shatters them into pebbles."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Although it is small, this POKéMON is very powerful because its body is a bundle of muscles. It launches head-butts with its ironlike skull."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its steel-hard head can shatter boulders. It longingly hopes for wings to grow so it can fly."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its steel-hard head can shatter boulders. It longingly hopes for wings to grow so it can fly."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its well-developed neck muscles and ironlike head can smash boulders into pieces."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its well-developed neck muscles and ironlike head can smash boulders into pieces."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il rêve de pouvoir voler un jour. Pour l’heure, il s’entraîne en sautant du haut des falaises."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il rêve de pouvoir voler un jour. Pour l’heure, il s’entraîne en sautant du haut des falaises."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il réduit en miettes les plus gros rochers grâce à son cou musculeux et à sa tête dure comme l’acier."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su desarrollado cuello y su cabeza dura como el acero le permiten reducir a añicos rocas enormes."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its well-developed neck muscles and iron-like head can smash boulders into pieces."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"鍛えられた 首の 筋肉と 鉄の ように 硬い 頭で 大岩を コナゴナに 砕く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il rêve de pouvoir voler un jour. Pour l’heure, il s’entraîne en sautant du haut des falaises."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sueña con volar algún día, por lo que siempre practica saltando desde acantilados."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"大空を 飛ぶことを 夢見て 毎日 飛ぶ 練習のために 崖から 飛び降りている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Draby rêve de pouvoir un jour s’élancer dans les cieux. Bien que voué à l’échec, ce Pokémon se jette des falaises pour essayer de voler. À force, sa tête est devenue aussi dure que de l’acier."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Bagon sueña con poder pasar un día volando por el cielo. En vanos intentos por volar, ha llegado a tirarse desde riscos. Como resultado de estas caídas en picado, se le ha puesto la cabeza dura como las piedras."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Bagon has a dream of one day soaring in the sky. In doomed efforts to fly, this Pokémon hurls itself off cliffs. As a result of its dives, its head has grown tough and as hard as tempered steel."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大空を 飛ぶことを 夢見て 繰り返し 断崖から 飛び降りている うちに 頭が 鍛えられ 鋼鉄の ように 硬く なった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Draby rêve depuis toujours de voler au milieu des nuages. Ce Pokémon éclate d’énormes rochers avec sa tête, comme pour exorciser le fait qu’il ne puisse pas voler."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Bagon sueña siempre con lo mismo: pasar todo un día volando entre las nubes. Frustrado ante la imposibilidad de volar, parece que se desahoga dándose cabezazos contra rocas enormes hasta hacerlas añicos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Bagon harbors a never-ending dream of one day soaring high among the clouds. As if trying to dispel its frustration over its inability to fly, this Pokémon slams its hard head against huge rocks and shatters them into pebbles."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"大空を 飛ぶことを 夢見ている ポケモン。 飛べない 悔しさを 晴らす ように 大岩に 石頭を 打ちつけては コナゴナに 砕く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Sa lubie de voler lui viendrait d’une information contenue dans ses gènes."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Parece ser que la información genética de los Bagon les impulsa a creer que algún día serán capaces de volar."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its belief that it will be able to fly one day is apparently the influence of information carried in its genes."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"いつか 飛べると 信じているのは 遺伝子の 中の 情報が 影響 しているから らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il charge sans distinction tout ce qui l’entoure, distribuant allègrement les coups de tête. Il extériorise ainsi son stress de ne pas voler."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Se lanza de cabeza contra todo lo que se le pone a tiro para lidiar con la frustración que le causa el no poder surcar los cielos."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"With its steel-hard stone head, it headbutts indiscriminately. This is because of the stress it feels at being unable to fly."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"鋼鉄並みの 石頭で やたら めったら 頭突きする。 空を 飛べない ストレスの せいだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il est jaloux des Pokémon oiseaux. Dès qu’il en voit un voler, il donne des coups de tête dans tous les sens et détruit tout sur son passage."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Cada vez que ve volar a un Pokémon pájaro le corroe la envidia por dentro y asesta cabezazos a todo lo que le rodea hasta hacerlo añicos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Whenever it sees bird Pokémon flying through the sky, it becomes envious and smashes its surroundings to bits with headbutts."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"空を飛ぶ とりポケモンを 見るたび 羨ましくなって ヘッドバッドで あたりのものを 粉々に 砕く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Selon certaines théories, il donne des coups de tête pour stimuler les cellules qui lui permettent d’évoluer."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Según una teoría, los fuertes cabezazos que propina estimulan las células implicadas en su evolución."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Some theories suggest that its behavior of forcefully bashing its head into things stimulates cells that affect its evolution."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"頭を 強く 打ちつける ことで 進化に 影響する 細胞を 刺激している という説も ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Tous les jours, il se jette du haut d’une falaise pour renforcer son corps, dans l’espoir de pouvoir voler un jour."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"En su afán por volar, fortalece su cuerpo a diario saltando desde acantilados."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Bagon jumps off cliffs every day, trying to grow stronger so that someday it will be able to fly."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"いつか 空を 飛ぶために 毎日 崖から 飛び降りて 体を 鍛える 訓練を 続けている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"La tête de ce Pokémon solitaire est si solide qu’il est capable de fendre en deux un rocher d’un seul coup."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Vive en solitario, sin formar manadas, y posee una cabeza dura como la piedra que le permite hacer añicos rocas enormes de un solo golpe."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Bagon is a solitary Pokémon that doesn’t form groups with others of its kind. It also has a head hard enough to cleave a boulder in one strike."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"群れを つくらず １匹で 暮らす。 一撃で 硬い 岩石を 真っ二つにする 石頭をもつ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":371,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[5,"level-up",17],[6,"level-up",17],[7,"level-up",17],[8,"level-up",16],[9,"level-up",16],[10,"level-up",16],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",16],[12,"level-up",17],[13,"level-up",17],[14,"level-up",16],[15,"level-up",16],[16,"level-up",17],[17,"level-up",17],[18,"level-up",17],[20,"level-up",15],[23,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[5,"level-up",53],[6,"level-up",53],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"level-up",53],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",55],[9,"level-up",55],[10,"level-up",55],[11,"level-up",55],[12,"level-up",53],[13,"level-up",53],[13,"tutor",0],[14,"level-up",55],[15,"level-up",55],[16,"level-up",49],[17,"level-up",49],[18,"level-up",49]